# Android packaging (docs/android-zapstore.md). Build outputs and signing
# material never belong in git: the release keystore is owner-held, and an
# APK in history is a binary nobody can audit against source.
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
*.keystore
*.jks
key.properties
android/**/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties

# Android build outputs (scripts/android/build.mjs)
android-dist/
